#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:1 73eafd598f8547958a6ed563bf8acd06
msgid "评估系统"
msgstr "Evaluation system"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:3 604beb1d895e45039946b2dfef3f41f9
msgid ""
"UniKT "
"的评估系统分为三层：指标计算（MetricsAccumulator）、指标记录（MetricLogger）和回调节点（Callback）。本页深入介绍每层的设计原理、调用链和数据流。"
msgstr ""
"The UniKT evaluation system is split into three layers: metric computation "
"(MetricsAccumulator), metric logging (MetricLogger), and callback nodes (Callback). "
"This page dives into the design rationale, call chain, and data flow of each layer."

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:5 cbac310b8e5046f78ce92330970014f2
msgid "架构总览"
msgstr "Architecture overview"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:24 80958ad1b9494d50ac6747d37a2b69a4
msgid "指标计算：MetricsAccumulator"
msgstr "Metric computation: MetricsAccumulator"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:26 81007bb658284221af2923f675215da5
msgid ""
"``MetricsAccumulator`` 位于 ``utils/training/metrics.py``，负责从 batch 级别的 "
"``forward_pass`` 输出累积到 epoch 级别的聚合指标。"
msgstr ""
"``MetricsAccumulator`` lives in ``utils/training/metrics.py`` and is responsible for "
"accumulating batch-level ``forward_pass`` output into epoch-level aggregate metrics."

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:28 8b69fed889e84c6283f3bb01384703b7
