#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:41 13b5a3afc571444588bfeb0f6236913e
msgid "以 GIKT 的 ``forward_pass`` 为例（``model/GIKT/GIKT_trainer.py`` ）："
msgstr "Using GIKT's ``forward_pass`` as an example (``model/GIKT/GIKT_trainer.py``):"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:60 f5564d40bd804e71b0000bc295cedf17
msgid ""
"GIKT 使用 ``y_score = y_hat``（logits 直接作为排序分数）和 ``y_prob = "
"sigmoid(y_hat)``（概率）。二分类阈值取 0.0，因为损失函数是 ``BCEWithLogitsLoss``（内部已含 "
"sigmoid）。"
msgstr ""
"GIKT uses ``y_score = y_hat`` (logits directly as the ranking score) and ``y_prob = "
"sigmoid(y_hat)`` (probability). The binary threshold is 0.0 because the loss is "
"``BCEWithLogitsLoss`` (sigmoid applied internally)."

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:62 32ddb0908e2d4f8fb0cf8de0d212e4b7
msgid "累积与聚合"
msgstr "Accumulation and aggregation"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:64 75172fdd250e4da48ad484a3eea6d9b1
msgid ""
"每个 batch 训练/验证后，训练循环调用 ``accumulator.update(phase, "
"output)``（``base_trainer.py`` 和 ）。累积器将 batch 级 tensor 移到 CPU 后存入列表，避免 GPU"
" 内存堆积。"
msgstr ""
"After each training/validation batch, the training loop calls "
"``accumulator.update(phase, output)`` (``base_trainer.py`` and ). The accumulator moves "
"the batch-level tensors to CPU and stores them in a list to avoid GPU memory buildup."

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:66 01eafc85b2254a6f933f75c641d5356f
msgid ""
"每个 epoch 结束时调用 ``accum.compute(phase)``（``base_trainer.py`` ），将所有 batch "
"拼接为 numpy 数组后计算三项核心指标："
msgstr ""
"At the end of each epoch, ``accum.compute(phase)`` is called (``base_trainer.py``), "
"which concatenates all batches into numpy arrays and computes the three core metrics:"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:68 e0c09ee9f19e465cb3ba6f9bf486b478
msgid "**ACC（准确率）** — 使用 ``sklearn.metrics.accuracy_score``："
msgstr "**ACC (accuracy)** — uses ``sklearn.metrics.accuracy_score``:"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:74 8663bca200d74a1ea41fcc19fbdb0d38
msgid "这里 ``y_pred`` 是 ``(y_score >= 0).float`` 产生的 0/1 二值预测。"
msgstr "Here ``y_pred`` is the 0/1 binary prediction produced by ``(y_score >= 0).float``."

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:76 fff2b61f02b045a9884cf1359c4f67ed
msgid "**AUC（ROC 曲线下面积）** — 使用 ``sklearn.metrics.roc_auc_score``："
msgstr "**AUC (area under the ROC curve)** — uses ``sklearn.metrics.roc_auc_score``:"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:85 88b9779075234680b6a9461688940714
msgid ""
"``roc_auc_score`` 对排序分数做全排序后计算 TPR/FPR 曲线下面积。当 ``y_label`` 全为 0 或全为 1 时 "
"``ValueError``，此时 AUC 设为 0.0。"
msgstr ""
"``roc_auc_score`` fully sorts the ranking scores and computes the area under the "
"TPR/FPR curve. When ``y_label`` is all 0 or all 1, a ``ValueError`` is raised and AUC "
"is set to 0.0."

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:87 9aa675c4acfb4b6d9da4297f28aae436
msgid "**RMSE（均方根误差）** — 使用 ``sklearn.metrics.root_mean_squared_error``："
msgstr ""
"**RMSE (root mean squared error)** — uses "
"``sklearn.metrics.root_mean_squared_error``:"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:93 976544551da04ecf90f81f8c5635c9c1
msgid "``y_prob`` 必须落在 [0, 1] 区间，由模型通过 sigmoid/softmax 保证。"
msgstr ""
"``y_prob`` must fall within the [0, 1] range, guaranteed by the model via "
"sigmoid/softmax."

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:95 3e483f20a6c74f5b944560901fcd2872
msgid "测试阶段的 Group 聚合"
msgstr "Group aggregation during the test phase"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:97 8fee879022ed4b3282456aabdcd764cf
msgid ""
"当 ``phase=\"test\"`` 且提供了 ``group_id`` 时，``compute(\"test\")`` "
"进入分组评估模式（``metrics.py`` ）。每个 group 内的多条题目记录被聚合为一条后计算指标，支持三种聚合策略："
msgstr ""
"When ``phase=\"test\"`` and ``group_id`` is provided, ``compute(\"test\")`` enters "
"grouped-evaluation mode (``metrics.py``). Multiple question records within each group "
"are aggregated into one before computing metrics, supporting three aggregation "
"strategies:"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md 7225384147624672afd5b1e1fb29e086
msgid "策略"
msgstr "Strategy"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md b2d42b05a2944f2a841c6fa453ee16ac
msgid "行为"
msgstr "Behavior"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md 2a243130d0b9436b9b8a4d7feeb16a3f
msgid "``mean``"
msgstr "``mean``"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md 3d8eed8d455d4ae8b15887a05ed6bad0
msgid "组内预测分数取均值"
msgstr "Take the mean of prediction scores within the group"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md d8fb4b1c79d74a5eb7a6adc682c607e9
msgid "``vote``"
msgstr "``vote``"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md e8bcff63469d4ab49f1f4944965c7d3e
msgid "按组内多数方向（对/错）取对应子集的均值；子集为空时回退整组均值"
msgstr ""
"Take the mean of the subset matching the group's majority direction (correct/wrong); "
"falls back to the whole-group mean when the subset is empty"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md 81d54702a4fe41f1b934ed2ace3207f9
msgid "``all``"
msgstr "``all``"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md 0ce7caa8e38c4b5c90e81eb07b8e7138
msgid "全对/全错组取整组均值；其余组按多数方向取子集均值"
msgstr ""
"All-correct/all-wrong groups use the whole-group mean; other groups use the subset "
"mean of the majority direction"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:106 74e69cbaf7484797b88c21b97776ee67
msgid ""
"三种策略的输出指标名分别前缀 ``mean_``、``vote_``、``all_``——例如 "
"``mean_acc``、``vote_auc``、``all_rmse``。Group 内标签必须一致，否则抛 "
"``ValueError``（）。"
msgstr ""
"The three strategies prefix the output metric names with ``mean_``, ``vote_``, "
"``all_`` respectively — e.g. ``mean_acc``, ``vote_auc``, ``all_rmse``. Labels within a "
"group must be consistent, otherwise a ``ValueError`` is raised ()."

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:108 0850ea390fe24b53911058e430cba69c
msgid "MetricLogger：记录后端"
msgstr "MetricLogger: logging backends"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:110 ccf8279755cd40d79a4f058df79deec4
msgid "MetricLogger 位于 ``utils/training/metric_logger.py``，提供统一的指标记录抽象，管理后端实例。"
msgstr ""
"MetricLogger lives in ``utils/training/metric_logger.py`` and provides a unified "
"metric-logging abstraction that manages backend instances."

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:112 aacb5b108885441fa83b1760e26c5768
msgid "注册机制"
msgstr "Registration mechanism"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:114 aea8eff5c85340969015d1087f2074c6
msgid ""
"使用 ``@register_metric_logger(\"name\")`` "
"装饰器注册，``METRIC_LOGGERS.get(\"name\")`` 获取："
msgstr ""
"Register with the ``@register_metric_logger(\"name\")`` decorator and retrieve via "
"``METRIC_LOGGERS.get(\"name\")``:"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:133 4013607232124330b85900e5e282496d
msgid "MetricLogger 与其他组件（训练器、参数配置、数据源、分析器）使用相同的注册机制。"
msgstr ""
"MetricLogger uses the same registration mechanism as the other components (trainers, "
"parameter configs, data sources, analyzers)."

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:135 51be7db1336f4a458e6973fc69f6eaa9
msgid "工厂函数：build_default_metric_loggers"
msgstr "Factory function: build_default_metric_loggers"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:137 272705e11adf497aa581f24d41a993e0
msgid ""
"训练器在 ``build`` 中通过 ``build_default_metric_loggers`` "
"创建后端组合（``base_trainer.py`` ）："
msgstr ""
"In ``build``, the trainer builds the backend combination via "
"``build_default_metric_loggers`` (``base_trainer.py``):"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:147 94fdf239c316446c8b9f858628125260
msgid "该工厂函数（``metric_logger.py`` ）保证："
msgstr "This factory function (``metric_logger.py``) guarantees:"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:149 0b46a0d7571c4f019da813924af61874
msgid "``LocalMetricLogger`` — **始终启用**，写入本地 CSV"
msgstr "``LocalMetricLogger`` — **always enabled**, writes local CSV"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:150 132bde71253e4124930d48c16c065f03
msgid "``SwanLabMetricLogger`` — 除非 ``--no_swanlab`` 为 True，否则自动附加"
msgstr ""
"``SwanLabMetricLogger`` — automatically attached unless ``--no_swanlab`` is True"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:151 3d2fd35d6ac44fb79dbfd262c43d9eb0
msgid "两者通过 ``MetricLoggerComposite`` 组合，任一后端异常不影响另一个（``metric_logger.py`` ）"
msgstr ""
"The two are composed via ``MetricLoggerComposite``; an exception in one backend does "
"not affect the other (``metric_logger.py``)"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:153 da0a0b4969c84e6ab44896d9eeb8e467
msgid "LocalMetricLogger：本地 CSV 记录"
msgstr "LocalMetricLogger: local CSV logging"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:155 a6a0f6f86fd24655931c835fd2c5d0bf
msgid "``LocalMetricLogger``（``metric_logger.py`` ）在 ``log_dir`` 下按 phase 写入 CSV："
msgstr ""
"``LocalMetricLogger`` (``metric_logger.py``) writes CSV per phase under ``log_dir``:"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:167 6f77feb7185c4a2c838bcb90bca539ac
msgid ""
"多阶段训练场景下，文件名以阶段名前缀区分：``metrics_Stage1_train.csv``、``metrics_Stage2_val.csv``。CSV"
" 表头惰性写入，句柄复用整个 run 期间不关闭，按需 ``flush`` 保证崩溃安全（）。"
msgstr ""
"In multi-stage training, filenames are distinguished by a stage-name prefix: "
"``metrics_Stage1_train.csv``, ``metrics_Stage2_val.csv``. The CSV header is written "
"lazily, the file handle is reused for the whole run without closing, and ``flush`` is "
"called on demand for crash safety ()."

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:169 e420e092ed0f404fb26a49626d1d6227
msgid "SwanLabMetricLogger：SwanLab 集成"
msgstr "SwanLabMetricLogger: SwanLab integration"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:171 ea1e7469eb854a7dac13dbc22b1d8676
msgid "``SwanLabMetricLogger``（``metric_logger.py`` ）将指标写入 SwanLab 云端/本地面板。"
msgstr ""
"``SwanLabMetricLogger`` (``metric_logger.py``) writes metrics to the SwanLab "
"cloud/local dashboard."

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:173 2af9febc95f84f2da6b0a80ba6bb451e
msgid "**初始化流程（``init_run``，）：**"
msgstr "**Initialization flow (``init_run``,):**"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:200 526289acbdce4e1f97895e1c887297eb
msgid "要点："
msgstr "Key points:"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:202 35c0482efba644da97fa488a7a325e59
msgid ""
"**惰性导入**：``swanlab`` 在方法内 ``import``，保持为可选依赖——标准环境下缺少 ``swanlab`` 不影响 "
"``import utils.training``"
msgstr ""
"**Lazy import**: ``swanlab`` is imported inside the method, keeping it an optional "
"dependency — a missing ``swanlab`` in the standard environment does not affect "
"``import utils.training``"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:203 a80f6bdfb7cc45d1aa86058e4df2aba8
msgid ""
"**环境变量**：通过 ``dotenv.load_dotenv`` 加载 ``.env`` 文件，支持 "
"``SWANLAB_WORKSPACE``、``LARK_WEBHOOK_URL``、``LARK_SECRET``"
msgstr ""
"**Environment variables**: the ``.env`` file is loaded via ``dotenv.load_dotenv``, "
"supporting ``SWANLAB_WORKSPACE``, ``LARK_WEBHOOK_URL``, ``LARK_SECRET``"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:204 b875de98f1564838b2ad047c684d265f
msgid "**飞书通知**：若配置了 ``LARK_WEBHOOK_URL``，训练异常时通过 ``LarkCallback`` 自动推送飞书消息"
msgstr ""
"**Lark notification**: if ``LARK_WEBHOOK_URL`` is configured, training failures are "
"pushed automatically to Lark via ``LarkCallback``"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:205 90869f27bf80483daefc7d10ab92101f
msgid ""
"**project_name** 固定为 ``\"kt-exp-graph\"``，``experiment_name`` 格式为 "
"``Run_<log_dir_basename>``"
msgstr ""
"**project_name** is fixed to ``\"kt-exp-graph\"``; ``experiment_name`` follows the "
"format ``Run_<log_dir_basename>``"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:206 968f844ba5e04ede8f4902aef670ea92
msgid "**group** 按模型类名分组（``model.__class__.__name__``），tags 标注 ``cuda`` 或 ``cpu``"
msgstr ""
"**group** groups by the model class name (``model.__class__.__name__``); tags mark "
"``cuda`` or ``cpu``"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:208 dde23a1bb1ab430ab4f09fa60edf5f70
msgid "**指标记录（``log_metrics``，）：**"
msgstr "**Metric logging (``log_metrics``,):**"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:219 664e0464d3a245a78898d5ae5daa7232
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"指标名按 ``{Stage/}{Phase/}{NAME}-epoch`` 格式上送，例如单阶段训练的 ``Train/AUC-"
"epoch``、``Val/ACC-epoch``，多阶段训练的 ``STAGE1/Train/AUC-epoch``。"
msgstr ""
"Metric names are uploaded in the format ``{Stage/}{Phase/}{NAME}-epoch`` — e.g. "
"``Train/AUC-epoch``, ``Val/ACC-epoch`` for single-stage training, and "
"``STAGE1/Train/AUC-epoch`` for multi-stage training."

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:221 3710aa2c312a40739007c7bf0aa64c28
msgid ""
"**生命周期：** ``init_run`` 在 ``_init_metric_logger`` 中调用（``base_trainer.py`` "
"），``finish`` 在 ``_finish_metric_logger`` 中调用（），对应训练的开始和结束。"
msgstr ""
"**Lifecycle:** ``init_run`` is called inside ``_init_metric_logger`` "
"(``base_trainer.py``) and ``finish`` inside ``_finish_metric_logger`` (), "
"corresponding to the start and end of training."

