msgstr "EarlyStoppingCallback"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:251 15cd3a50413a46c99e26d5c58d692433
msgid ""
"``EarlyStoppingCallback``（``callbacks.py`` "
"）在验证阶段结束时（``on_phase_end``，phase=\"val\"）执行两步操作："
msgstr ""
"At the end of the validation phase (``on_phase_end``, phase=\"val\"), "
"``EarlyStoppingCallback`` (``callbacks.py``) performs two steps:"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:253 410bf76fb20c4a558cb58391c81b3c87
msgid ""
"从 metrics 中提取监控指标值（``_select_monitor_value``，），按 ``es_monitor`` "
"指定的名称查找，找不到时按 auc → acc → rmse 顺序回退"
msgstr ""
"Extract the monitored metric value from metrics (``_select_monitor_value``,), looking "
"it up by the ``es_monitor`` name and falling back in the order auc → acc → rmse when "
"not found"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:254 d99f5bb499ef425fa9da7db3734a80a8
msgid "调用 ``early_stopping.step(current, epoch, metrics)`` 判断是否触发早停"
msgstr "Call ``early_stopping.step(current, epoch, metrics)`` to decide whether to trigger early stopping"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:255 e2f6458e33c34b018f3b1ae8a6a92ea0
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"将早停状态写入 ``metric_logger.log_early_stopping``，同时记录到 SwanLab 的 "
"``ES/Best``、``ES/Num_Bad_Epochs``、``ES/Best_{METRIC}`` 面板"
msgstr ""
"Write the early-stopping state via ``metric_logger.log_early_stopping`` and log it to "
"the SwanLab panels ``ES/Best``, ``ES/Num_Bad_Epochs``, ``ES/Best_{METRIC}``"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:257 72949bea17db476c924fdabc92596f10
msgid "CheckpointCallback"
msgstr "CheckpointCallback"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:259 a6581e25cde94e5ca493bd383aef61d0
msgid "``CheckpointCallback``（``callbacks.py`` ）在两个时机操作："
msgstr "``CheckpointCallback`` (``callbacks.py``) operates at two points:"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:261 41298404b8b74019a344c265aa3ec50c
msgid ""
"``on_epoch_end``：保存 ``last_checkpoint.pth``（完整状态：model + optimizer + "
"scheduler + early_stopping）"
msgstr ""
"``on_epoch_end``: saves ``last_checkpoint.pth`` (full state: model + optimizer + "
"scheduler + early_stopping)"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:262 4e221e2cfa484e2fb8fa7314146014b3
msgid ""
"``on_phase_end``（phase=\"val\"）：根据 ``monitor`` 指标判断当前是否是最佳 epoch，若是则保存 "
"``best_model.pth``（仅模型权重）"
msgstr ""
"``on_phase_end`` (phase=\"val\"): checks the ``monitor`` metric to decide whether the "
"current epoch is the best; if so, saves ``best_model.pth`` (model weights only)"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:264 d8bcfaee88f94c168923fb03cb2277d5
msgid ""
"``CheckpointCallback`` 的 ``monitor`` 可与早停的 ``monitor`` 解耦——通过构造函数的 "
"``monitor`` 参数显式传入（），默认跟随 ``early_stopping``。"
msgstr ""
"The ``monitor`` of ``CheckpointCallback`` can be decoupled from the early-stopping "
"``monitor`` — pass it explicitly via the ``monitor`` argument of the constructor (), "
"by default it follows ``early_stopping``."

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:266 0912190b0fbe4cefbfb346502b64a35c
msgid "TestEvaluationCallback"
msgstr "TestEvaluationCallback"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:268 2448482ec9ce4da5953912452f80b904
