"``_evaluate_on_test_set(use_best_model=True)``（``base_trainer.py`` ）："
msgstr ""
"``TestEvaluationCallback`` (``callbacks.py``) is triggered at ``on_train_end`` and "
"calls ``_evaluate_on_test_set(use_best_model=True)`` (``base_trainer.py``):"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:270 2e94710ee070459880ef3c7b968470d6
