msgid "遍历测试集 DataLoader，每条样本调 ``test_forward_pass``（默认同 ``forward_pass``）"
msgstr ""
"Iterate the test-set DataLoader, calling ``test_forward_pass`` for each sample "
"(defaults to the same as ``forward_pass``)"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:272 a51b15ff927741bc83a3bdeba6400b51
msgid "累积到 ``MetricsAccumulator`` 的 \"test\" phase"
msgstr "Accumulate into the \"test\" phase of ``MetricsAccumulator``"

#: ../../source/advanced/evaluation.md:273 da722dcc2a1a4d72823181767f56d23b
msgid "调用 ``metric_logger.log_metrics(phase=\"test\", ...)`` 写入 CSV + SwanLab"
